{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"英國曼徹斯特演唱會疑有人放出不明物質　逾1.2萬人緊急疏散\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/UK-CONCERT-261123-16.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】英國曼徹斯特一場演唱會懷疑有人放出不明物質，場內超過一萬二千人需要緊急疏散。</p><p>事發在當地周日晚上十時後，當時演唱會接近尾聲，部分觀眾突然不適，懷疑有人發放催淚氣體，超過50人即場接受檢查，主要是眼及呼吸道不適，其中一人需要送院。警方列為「重大事件」調查。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:23:53.320141+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:11:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T03:37:16.354302+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:26.390538+00:00","content_hash":"6de30215e364a243a4d252e9d770d12ae71dbf61004c867de7b0d99d0747f113","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:23:53.320141+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}